The files in this directory (stars.json, constellations.json) are derived
data, built by tools/parse_stellarium_data.py from two upstream sources that
are themselves licensed CC BY-SA 4.0:

  - HYG Database v4.1 (star positions, magnitudes, proper names)
    https://codeberg.org/astronexus/hyg
  - Stellarium "modern_iau" skyculture (constellation line figures)
    https://github.com/Stellarium/stellarium
    (skycultures/modern_iau)

Under CC BY-SA 4.0's ShareAlike clause, these derived files — and any
redistribution or adaptation of them — must remain under CC BY-SA 4.0 with
attribution, even though the surrounding StarMapper source code is MIT
licensed. See CREDITS.md at the repo root for full attribution text.

